1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,578
Skill Atlas web view: scan a whole organization, github.com/ndkoval

2
00:00:03,628 --> 00:00:05,007
Skills grouped by repository; broken front matter shows as a warning

3
00:00:05,057 --> 00:00:06,359
Filter by text: instant, no new scan, matches highlighted

4
00:00:06,409 --> 00:00:08,450
Error handling: a clear message, never a partial result

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,950
It starts with a GitHub issue labelled "Delegated to AI": yours, or a bug the Red Agent found

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,250
Air automation "Issue To PR" implements it and opens a pull request…

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,450
…or first asks for details on Slack, then goes on with the answers

8
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,950
Then Code Review reviews the PR, Address Review answers, QA tests it on request

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,950
And a status update in Slack, whenever you ask for one
